<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is carrier of"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "b is carrier of c =Def there is some time t such that c generically depends on b at t"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Users that require more sophisticated representations of time are encouraged to import a temporal extension of BFO-Core provided by the BFO development team. See documentation for guidance: <Link>"@en .
