<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002135> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001933> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#real> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "has specified numeric value" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A relation between a value specification and a number that quantifies it."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "A range of 'real' might be better than 'float'. For now we follow 'has measurement value' until we can consider technical issues with SPARQL queries and reasoning." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: James A. Overton" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "OBI" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has specified numeric value" .
