_:genid155 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> "b is a role means: b is a realizable entity & b exists because there is some single bearer that is in some special physical, social, or institutional set of circumstances in which this bearer does not have to be& b is not such that, if it ceases to exist, then the physical make-up of the bearer is thereby changed. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [061-001])"@en .
_:genid155 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/061-001> .
