<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000409> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "The Basic Formal Ontology ontology makes a distinction between Universals and defined classes, where the formal are \"natural kinds\" and the latter arbitrary collections of entities."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000409> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A denotator type indicates how a term should be interpreted from an ontological perspective."@en .
