# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000892> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Instances of Portions Of Matter whose shape is relevant for their dispostion to participate in a Manufacturing Process may be SemiFinishedProdcuts."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The sum of portions of matter of the same type form a portion of matter of that type."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Material"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Material"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Material is a Portion Of Matter that has the disposition to participate in some Manifacturing Process and whose shape is not relevant for its disposition to participate in the Manifacuring Process."@en .
