<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000005> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Material Property"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A property is a material trait in terms of the kind and magnitude of response to a specific imposed stimulus. Generally, definitions of properties are made independent of material shape and size.\n\n(Callister, W.D., Rethwisch, D.G., Materials Science and Engineering, Wiley, 2014)\n\nWe only deal with intensive (system-size independent) materrial properties. Extensive properties that depend on the testpiece/specimen/probe size should be found in the respective testing method modules."@en .
