<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ab Initio MD Simulation"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ab Initio MD Simulation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Simulation Process that uses quantum mechanical calculations to predict the behavior of molecular systems without empirical parameters."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Simulationsprozess, der quantenmechanische Berechnungen verwendet, um das Verhalten molekularer Systeme ohne empirische Parameter vorherzusagen."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Simulating the electronic structure and dynamics of a new alloy to predict its mechanical properties."@en .
