<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000546> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "ChatGPT 4.o" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000546> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ceramic"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000546> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ceramics are engineered materials described as non-metallic, inorganic materials characterized by high hardness, brittleness, and heat resistance, commonly used in engineering applications."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000547
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000547> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
