<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Chemical Composition"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The chemical composition is a morphological quality describing the types and proportions of elements or compounds present in a material."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PMDco Team" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "chatgpt 4.o"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Analyseverfahren für die chemische Zusammensetzung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Chemical Composition Analyzing Process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Structural Property Analyzing Process that determines the chemical composition of a material by identifying and quantifying its constituent elements and compounds."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Struktur Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren, das die chemische Zusammensetzung eines Materials bestimmt, indem es dessen Bestandteile und Verbindungen identifiziert und quantifiziert."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000985> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "ChatGPT 4.o" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Chemical Potential"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The chemical potential is a thermodynamic quality describing the energy change associated with the addition of a small quantity of a substance to a system at constant temperature and pressure."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001025> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PMDco Team" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "chatgpt 4.o"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Chemical Property Analyzing Process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Chemische Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An assay that determines the chemical composition, reactivity, and chemical stability of materials, including the identification and quantification of chemical elements and compounds."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine Analyse, die die chemische Zusammensetzung, Reaktivität und chemische Stabilität von Materialien bestimmt, einschließlich der Identifizierung und Quantifizierung chemischer Elemente und Verbindungen."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000555
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000555> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000555> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000034> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000555> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PMDco Team" .
