<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000577> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Composite Material"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Composite Material is an Engineered Material that 'consists of' some Material that has a Matrix role and of some Material that has a Filler role."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000806> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PMDco Team" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Official definition can be found in: DIN 8593-1"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Offizielle Definition findet man in: DIN 8593-1"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compounding"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Zusammensetzen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Putting Together"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A joining process that involves assembling various components or sub-assemblies to form a complex unit, commonly used in manufacturing processes where multiple parts are put together to create a final product."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Füge Prozess, bei dem verschiedene Komponenten oder Unterbaugruppen zu einer komplexen Einheit zusammengefügt werden. Es wird üblicherweise in Fertigungsprozessen verwendet, bei denen mehrere Teile zu einem Endprodukt zusammengefügt werden."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Interlocking, Layering"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000579
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000579> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000579> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000579> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PMDco Team" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000579> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "ChatGPT 3.5"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000579> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compoundiermaschine"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000579> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compounding Machine"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A device used for mixing or compounding materials to achieve desired properties."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Gerät zur Mischung oder Compoundierung von Materialien, um gewünschte Eigenschaften zu erreichen."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000580
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000580> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000580> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000580> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PMDco Team" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000580> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "ChatGPT 3.5"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000580> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compression Testing Machine"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000580> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Druckprüfmaschine"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A device used to test the compressive strength of materials by applying a compressive force."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Gerät zur Prüfung der Druckfestigkeit von Materialien durch Anwendung einer Druckkraft."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000581
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000581> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000581> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000581> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PMDco Team" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000581> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "chatgpt 4.o"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000581> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compression Testing Process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000581> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Druckprüfverfahren"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Mechanical Property Analyzing Processs that determines a material's behavior under compressive forces, measuring its compressive strength and modulus."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Mechanische Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren, das das Verhalten eines Materials unter Druckkräften bestimmt und seine Druckfestigkeit und seinen Druckmodul misst."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Compression testing of concrete samples to ensure they meet the required strength standards for construction."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000582
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000582> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000582> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000582> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000582> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Computer"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000582> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Computing Device"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A computing system that provides an execution environment for, e.g., simulation processes or prediction models.\nA computing system can be virtual (e.g., a container or virtual machine) or physical (e.g., a bare-metal servers), uses digital representations of objects as inputs and produces digital measurements, such as simulation results or predictions, as outputs."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Rechnersystem, das eine Ausführungsumgebung bspw. für Simulationsprozesse oder Vorhersagemodelle bereitstellt.\nEin Rechenknoten kann virtuell (bspw. ein Container oder eine virtuelle Maschine) oder physisch (z. B. ein Bare-Metal-Server) ausgestaltet sein und verwendet in der Regel digitale Repräsentationen von Objekten als Eingaben und erzeugt digitale Messungen, wie z.B. Simulationsergebnisse oder Vorhersagen, als Ausgaben."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid291 .
_:genid291 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
