<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Seperating process that involves separating material into distinct parts using techniques like shear cutting, splitting, tearing, or breaking, typically employed in processes where precise control over the cut is less critical."@en .
