<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000772> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Hardening By Forming"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000772> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Verfestigen Durch Umformen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Changing Properties Of Material process, that involves altering material properties by mechanical deformation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Stoffeigenschaft Ändern Prozess, der die Eigenschaften des Materials durch mechanische Verformung verändert."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Sheet Metal Rolling to Achieve Higher Strength."@en .
