# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000780
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000780> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000780> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000780> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PMDco Team" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000780> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "ChatGPT 3.5"@en .
