<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000802> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An irradiation process is a process in which a radiation source (bearing a stimulus role) emits radiation towards a material entity (bearing the target role)"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000803
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000803> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000803> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> .
