<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000812> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Joining Function"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000812> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Verbindungsfunktion"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A function performed to connect or bond materials together through various methods such as welding or soldering."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine Funktion, die ausgeführt wird, um Materialien durch verschiedene Methoden wie Schweißen oder Löten zu verbinden."@de .
