<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A laboratory role is a role specifying the functions or activities specific to experimental and analytical tasks performed in a laboratory setting."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000816
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000816> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
