<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Physical Simulation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A physical simulation is a simulating process describing the use of computational or experimental methods to replicate physical behaviors or processes under defined conditions."@en .
