<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "A measure of a material's resistance to deformation or scratching by a harder material." .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Scratch Hardness"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The scratch hardness is a hardness representing a measure of a material's resistance to deformation or scratching by a harder material."@en .
