<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000941> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000941> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000941> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PMDco Team" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000941> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "chatgpt 4.o" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000941> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Abplatzprüfverfahren"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000941> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Spalling Testing Process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Mechanical Property Analyzing Process that evaluates the resistance of a material to surface spalling or flaking under high impact or thermal stresses."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Mechanische Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren, das die Widerstandsfähigkeit eines Materials gegen Oberflächenabplatzungen oder Abblättern unter hohen Stoß- oder thermischen Belastungen bewertet."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Spalling testing of refractory bricks used in furnaces to ensure their longevity and performance under extreme conditions."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000942
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000942> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000942> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000863> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000942> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "ChatGPT 4.o" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000942> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Specific Surface Area"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The specific surface area is a morphologic quality describing the total surface area of a material per unit of mass or volume."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "Specimen Role" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "ANMERKUNG: Ein Specimen ist ein Teilstück (potenziell alles) eines Samples, welches für die Herstellung von Test Pieces bearbeitet wurde, jedoch nicht zwingend das Test Piece selbst darstellt. CAVE: Diese Anmerkung beschreibt das Objekt, welches die Rolle, die durch diese owl:Class definiert wird, realisiert.\nANMERKUNG: Die exakte Wortwahl der EN 10021 wurde verallgemeinert."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "In certain cases, the specimen can be the sample or the test piece itself."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Mitunter kann der Probenabschnitt (Sample) unmittelbar als Prüfling (Specimen) oder der Prüfling (Specimen) unmittelbar als Probe (Test Piece) dienen."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "NOTE: A Specimen is a part (potentially the whole) taken from a Sample, which was somehow machined/altered for the production of Test Pieces; it does not necessarily represent the Test Piece itself. CAVE: This note describes the object, that realizes the role defined by this owl:Class.\nNOTE: The wording used in EN 10021 was generalized."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Matthias Jung" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "EN 10021:2006-12 (European standardization committee: CEN/TC 459/SC 12/WG 4)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Prüfling-Rolle"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Specimen Role"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Role of an object which has been taken from a sample by forming and/or machining and/or heat treatment for the pupose of producing test pieces."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Rolle eines Objektes, das aus einem Probenabschnitt (Sample) entnommen wurde (durch Umformen und/oder maschinelles Bearbeiten und/oder Wärmebehandlung) mit dem Zweck Proben (Test Pieces) aus diesem Objekt herzustellen."@de .
