<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000982> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An assay that measures the thermal behavior of materials, including heat capacity, thermal conductivity, thermal expansion, and phase transitions in response to temperature changes."@en .
