<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001025> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001025> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid433 .
_:genid433 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
_:genid433 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#intersectionOf> _:genid436 .
_:genid436 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid434 .
_:genid434 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:genid434 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:genid435 .
_:genid435 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000014> .
