_:genid434 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
_:genid436 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> .
_:genid436 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001025> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Assay the wavelength of light emitted by excited Neon atoms. Count of geese flying over a house."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001025> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "measuring"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001025> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "scientific observation"@en .
