<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020098> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000031> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020098> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Nature constant"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A nature constant is a generically dependent continuant whose value, magintude or configuration is determined by nature including physics and mathematics."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Examples of nature constants are the speed of light, pi, and the 14 Bravais lattices."@en .
