<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000227> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "terms merged"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000227> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "An editor note should explain what were the merged terms and the reason for the merge."@en .
